# redis:7.4.11-alpine — Alpine 3.21 OpenSSL 3.3.7-r1 (fixed in -r2, not yet in
# the official image). Redis here runs without TLS on the Docker network, so
# no TLS handshake or certificate ever reaches libssl. Short expiry: the
# official image is rebuilt often and Dependabot moves the digest.
CVE-2026-75804 exp:2026-11-15
CVE-2026-84782 exp:2026-11-15
